<title>USA: Canton Building Authority, Mich., won by Dain.</title>
<headline>Canton Building Authority, Mich., won by Dain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it won $3.500 million of Canton Charter Township Building Authority, Mich., 1996 building authority lease rental revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.3068 percent.</p>
</text>
